[[1," أَرَءَيْتَ ٱلَّذِى يُكَذِّبُ بِٱلدِّينِ","Have you seen the one who denies the Recompense?","Araayta allathee yukaththibu biddeen",602,30,0],[2,"فَذَٰلِكَ ٱلَّذِى يَدُعُّ ٱلْيَتِيمَ","For that is the one who drives away the orphan","Fathalika allathee yaduAAAAualyateem",602,30,0],[3,"وَلَا يَحُضُّ عَلَىٰ طَعَامِ ٱلْمِسْكِينِ","And does not encourage the feeding of the poor.","Wala yahuddu AAalataAAami almiskeen",602,30,0],[4,"فَوَيْلٌ لِّلْمُصَلِّينَ","So woe to those who pray","Fawaylun lilmusalleen",602,30,0],[5,"ٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ عَن صَلَاتِهِمْ سَاهُونَ","[But] who are heedless of their prayer -","Allatheena hum AAan salatihimsahoon",602,30,0],[6,"ٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ يُرَآءُونَ","Those who make show [of their deeds]","Allatheena hum yuraoon",602,30,0],[7,"وَيَمْنَعُونَ ٱلْمَاعُونَ","And withhold [simple] assistance.","WayamnaAAoona almaAAoon",602,30,0]]